  {
    "id": "3820128558",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Dot Field · 柔光点阵",
    "description": "一张安静、克制的交互式点阵壁纸。\n\n石墨灰哑光底色，柔和暖白光与轻微的浮雕质感。\n移动鼠标，光源与点阵轻轻跟随；停下后，表面缓缓恢复平静。\n\n只保留三个简单设置：\n• 点阵疏密：选择更舒展或更紧凑的排列。\n• 画面亮度：适应屏幕和环境光。\n• 鼠标起伏：调整形变幅度；设为 0 可关闭形变，保留光照跟随。\n\n颜色、材质和运动节奏已经搭配好，默认即可使用。\n画面稳定后停止绘制，移动鼠标自动恢复。\n支持不同分辨率与超宽屏。无音频，无需联网加载素材。\n\nA quiet, restrained interactive dot-field wallpaper.\nMatte graphite, soft warm light, and subtle surface relief.\nMove your cursor to guide the light and gently deform the surface.\n\nJust three controls: density, brightness, and surface response.\nSet surface response to zero to keep the light interaction without deformation.\nThe palette, material, and motion are tuned to work together out of the box.\nRendering stops once the surface settles and resumes when you move the cursor.\nNo audio or online assets required.",
    "author": {
